{
  "_comment": [
    "Stormwind's ambience, played by our own sound engine (.agents/docs/systems/evolutions-audio.md) while the",
    "player is in the city: the Trade District's square as its loud heart (crowds, people talking and laughing,",
    "children, pigeons overhead), the bank, the taverns, Cathedral Square, the Dwarven District's forge at work,",
    "the harbour (creaking ships, gulls circling, a far fog horn), the park's birds, Old Town's dogs and",
    "cats. Voices are the client's own (its language), the rest the game's or Ascension's (retail). The city's own",
    "fountains, lamps, banners and hourly bells already have their sounds: none here."
